#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:12 511219faace746af9abf5113173cf393
msgid "Part II — The Prose Layer"
msgstr "第二部分 —— 文稿层"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:24 de2fedae07544e87831337f57b027922
msgid ""
"The five chapters of Part II, on one page — a storage choice (Ch 4) whose "
"trust properties (Ch 5) the pipeline (Ch 6) must preserve, served through "
"search and a static site (Ch 7), with an operational model (Ch 7a) that "
"keeps the whole thing honest as the code underneath changes:"
msgstr ""
"第二部分的五章，浓缩在一页：一个**存储选型**（第 4 章），它的**信任属性**（第 5 章）必须被**流水线**（第 6 "
"章）一路保住，经由搜索和静态站点（第 7 章）对外服务，再加上一套**运维模型**（第 7a 章）—— 在底下的代码持续变化时，让整套东西仍然是诚实的："

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:61 29c0de3f31a34defbe0c654afdb02381
msgid "Why"
msgstr "为什么"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:63 0c22f8bf9a5048e9bd600f831b434415
msgid ""
"Human-authored prose — tutorials, how-tos, runbooks, ADRs — is the oldest "
"layer of a software KB and the one machines cannot produce on their own. "
"Part II shows how the prose-layer reference implementation keeps that layer "
"trustworthy, searchable, and automatable without locking the content into a "
"proprietary system — and how to keep it correct over time."
msgstr ""
"人写的文稿 —— 教程、how-to、runbook、ADR —— "
"是软件知识库最古老的那一层，也是唯一机器没办法凭空生成的那一层。第二部分展示的是：文稿层参考实现如何让这一层**可信、可搜、可自动化**，同时不把内容锁死在某个专有系统里"
" —— 以及如何让它**随时间推移仍然正确**。"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:69 c21116bfbcef44958a4297e8a7a5aa3e
msgid "Where Part II sits in the book"
msgstr "**第二部分在书里的位置**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:71 bf1d1243843d4380b2990409a33ef4a5
msgid ""
"Part II is the first of the book's two parallel \"layer\" parts. Part III "
"takes the same shape — five chapters that pick a substrate, harden its "
"contract, run a pipeline over it, expose it for search, and close with an "
"operational model — but applied to *code* rather than *prose*. Part V then "
"shows the two layers cooperating (a document-layering tuple that reads both;"
" a retrieval surface that fuses prose passages with code embeddings). "
"Reading Part II alone gives you a defensible prose-layer KB; reading Parts "
"II and III together gives you the substrate Part V turns into a code-aware "
"knowledge base; Part VI is governance for everything Parts II–V produced."
msgstr ""
"**第二部分是这本书里****两个平行的“层”部分**中的**第一个**。**第三部分**走的是**同一个形状** —— "
"**五章**：**选定一个承载层、把它的契约锤结实、在它之上跑一条流水线、把它暴露出去以便查询、****最后以一个运维模型收尾** —— "
"**只不过应用对象是** *代码* **而不是** *文稿* "
"。**第五部分**随后**展示这两层怎么协作**（**一个同时读这两层的文档分层元组**；**一个把文稿段落和代码 embedding "
"融合在一起的检索面**）。**单读第二部分**，你会得到**一个站得住脚的文稿层知识库**；**第二、第三部分一起读**，**你会得到****第五部分用来变成一个懂代码的知识库的那块承载层**；**第六部分**是**对第二到第五部分所产出之一切的治理**。"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:91 da8bbf31074f4ffcbef7d601684dd11c
msgid ""
"The prose-layer structure is deliberately mirrored in Part III's close: "
"*four corners* on each side, so that the book's Parts V and VI can talk "
"about both layers in the same vocabulary. Noticing the mirror is the cheap "
"way to internalise the shape; §\"How\" below names the mirror explicitly."
msgstr ""
"**文稿层的结构**，**被刻意地镜像到****第三部分的收尾**里： *两边各四个角* "
"，**这样**这本书的**第五、第六部分****就可以用同一套词汇讨论两层**。 *注意到这次镜像* "
"，**是内化这个形状的最便宜的方法**；**下面的** §“How” **会把这次镜像显式命名出来**。"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:97 87f8093f905242ee92fb145f008538ab
msgid "What"
msgstr "是什么"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:99 7f794de6efc6464fb5b5d545e4652028
msgid ""
"A file-based wiki (Chapter 4), YAML frontmatter + footer as the two-block "
"provenance-and-review record (Chapter 5), the classification pipeline "
"(Chapter 6), publishing and in-memory search (Chapter 7), and an operational"
" model for keeping the prose correct as the code underneath it changes "
"(Chapter 7a)."
msgstr ""
"一个基于文件的 wiki（第 4 章），由 YAML frontmatter 加 footer 组成的双块「来源 + 评审」记录（第 5 "
"章），分类流水线（第 6 章），发布与内存搜索（第 7 章），以及一套在底下的代码持续变化时、仍让文稿保持正确的**运维模型**（第 7a 章）。"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:105 652c4de611cb42558fb9107cc631b58f
msgid "The five chapters as a dependency chain"
msgstr "**把这五章看作一条依赖链**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:107 8da3764a69af49f68d1dd3b4714f325a
msgid ""
"The chapters are not independent essays; each is the substrate the next one "
"stands on. The table below makes the substrate relation explicit — if you "
"are deciding where to cut the part for a short reading session, cutting "
"*across* the dependency arrows is cheaper than cutting *along* them."
msgstr ""
"**这些章节不是彼此独立的散论**；**每一章都是下一章所站立的承载层**。**下面这张表**把这种**承载关系**显式化 —— "
"**如果你要决定****把这个部分在一次短时间阅读里切在哪里**， *沿与依赖箭头正交的方向切* ，**比** *沿着它们切* **更便宜**。"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 5ba136e7ccb341fdb1249a63b21c1414
msgid "Chapter"
msgstr "**章**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 c79af1d6484a4141bcf3e2f570d6f732
msgid "Picks up from"
msgstr "**接自**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 c537ef82e3de4cf0a775c4d2f35f8e43
msgid "Produces"
msgstr "**产出**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 ca1aa9ef80984d7fa564e079a0e07486
msgid "Consumed by"
msgstr "**被谁消费**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 3d995ac4189c4e67bfdb797f97783793
msgid "**Ch 4** File-based wiki"
msgstr "**第 4 章** 基于文件的 wiki"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 3dafef1c09a54ea0b13031e67313381d
msgid "Part I's \"KB as code\" thesis"
msgstr "**第一部分**“**知识库即代码**”的主张"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 c97ef95250e743e08870f8799f71fedc
msgid ""
"`WikiRepository` + `FileRepository` + the \"Git is your audit log\" contract"
msgstr "`WikiRepository` + `FileRepository` + “**Git 就是你的审计日志**”这份契约"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 35957bdfbb8f4cd79c6cd7f9b7956dc4
msgid "Everything else in Part II; ch14 (drift detection)"
msgstr "**第二部分其余所有章节**；**第 14 章（漂移检测）**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 ec872b14014847ecad14b58073d77a32
msgid "**Ch 5** Provenance"
msgstr "**第 5 章** 来源"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 dc2efb243e9d43719ab6b76d62e212a8
msgid "Ch 4's filesystem contract"
msgstr "**第 4 章**的**文件系统契约**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 eb1d8c490a6442459918a2892aacb74e
msgid ""
"Frontmatter (lineage) + `PKB-metadata` footer (review) + the AI-sets-pending"
" rule"
msgstr ""
"Frontmatter（**谱系**）+ `PKB-metadata` footer（**评审**）+ **AI 写入即 pending 规则**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 b6bad22d27734f05a0502589a8ab6c69
msgid "Ch 6's ingest (writes footers); ch15 gates; ch18 document layering"
msgstr "**第 6 章的 ingest**（**写 footer**）；**第 15 章的闸**；**第 18 章的文档分层**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 ebebb75a9bde46f891bd53f427ae2d89
msgid "**Ch 6** Pipeline"
msgstr "**第 6 章** 流水线"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 79346b0d0f9246fc8e204cf3c13283e3
msgid "Ch 4 (files) + Ch 5 (schema)"
msgstr "**第 4 章（文件）+ 第 5 章（schema）**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 074a6cf5b29d4453a2395f5a1125e3bd
msgid ""
"Six CLI verbs; ingest that writes well-formed files with `unreviewed` trust;"
" an append-only governance log"
msgstr "**六个 CLI 动词**；**能写出规格良好、信任为 `unreviewed` 的文件的 ingest**；**一份只追加的治理日志**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 74fecb7b8afe4791963d55986f2ca86a
msgid "Ch 7 (indexes files it produced); ch14 (re-triggers ingest on drift)"
msgstr "**第 7 章**（**给它产出的文件建索引**）；**第 14 章**（**漂移时重新触发 ingest**）"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 6c306e8559e84c5c8edeb6550bd26bbf
msgid "**Ch 7** Publish + search"
msgstr "**第 7 章** 发布 + 搜索"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 f1b1e083963b486b9ccc614eace5ac27
msgid "Ch 6's committed tree"
msgstr "**第 6 章**已经**提交进仓库的那棵文件树**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 a334a14878b64bcb876028490439dd03
msgid "In-memory postings list for the live server; Sphinx static build"
msgstr "**在线服务用的内存里 postings list**；**Sphinx 静态构建**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 2fdc6d1be2e041879d187bef20ea516c
msgid ""
"Ch 7a's \"what can gates check?\" (search is *not* a gate); ch21's agent "
"retrieval"
msgstr "**第 7a 章**的“**闸能检查什么？**”（**搜索** *不是* **闸**）；**第 21 章的 agent 检索**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 4d54195784a94688be965d0458786f15
msgid "**Ch 7a** Operational model"
msgstr "**第 7a 章** 运维模型"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 b61a49b371354568a8acb43c3c14bb3b
msgid "Everything above"
msgstr "**以上的全部**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 e0324161cbba44c29912e36e3c2e9ed8
msgid "Four-corner model C1–C4; the Part II checklist"
msgstr "**四角模型 C1–C4**；**第二部分的清单**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 c59b3f7c6c064a199a46534679f3b5ee
msgid ""
"Ch 14 (change detection, C2-driven); ch15 (gates, C4); ch16 (three-level "
"updates, C3); ch18/ch21 (both layers)"
msgstr ""
"**第 14 章（变更检测，由 C2 驱动）**；**第 15 章（闸，C4）**；**第 16 章（三级更新，C3）**；**第 18/21 "
"章（两层都会被处理）**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:121 a2d11593c98941758b25c2fd9851444c
msgid ""
"Two arrows are worth singling out. Chapter 5's frontmatter contract is the "
"*only* artefact the live server (Ch 7) and the classification pipeline (Ch "
"6) *both* read — if you break the schema in Ch 5, you break both consumers "
"at once. And Chapter 7a's footer (C2) is the one field every later chapter "
"in Parts IV–VI touches, because it is the hinge between per-page state and "
"the operational cycle that acts on it."
msgstr ""
"**有两条箭头值得单独拎出来讲**。**第 5 章**的 frontmatter 契约**是在线服务**（**第 7 "
"章**）和**分类流水线**（**第 6 章**） *同时* 读的**唯一一份**制品 —— **如果你把第 5 章的 schema "
"改坏了**，**这两个消费者会一起坏**。而**第 7a 章的 footer "
"（C2）**，**是后续第四、五、六部分里****每一章都会触碰的那一个字段** —— "
"**因为它是按页状态和对这种状态做事的那个运维循环之间的铰链**。"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:129 5e3cb2229b704ec9909b6a390c7d6617
msgid "How"
msgstr "怎么做"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:131 93122ff18f504b159ddf56f6d0a5f369
msgid ""
"Five chapters. Chapters 4–7 handle *getting prose in*. Chapter 7a closes "
"Part II with the four-corner operational model (opinionated page set, "
"metadata footer, three-level updates, verification gates) that Part IV and "
"ch18/ch21/ch22 later operationalise, and that mirrors Part III's four-corner"
" close (parsing / embeddings / graph / prompt)."
msgstr ""
"五章。第 4–7 章负责 *把文稿收进来* 。第 7a 章用一个「四角」运维模型收尾：一份**固定的页面集**、一个**元数据 "
"footer**、**三级更新策略**、以及**校验闸**。这四个角后面在第四部分以及第 18、21、22 "
"章里被具体落地，和第三部分结尾的另一个「四角」（解析 / embedding / 图谱 / prompt）互为镜像。"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:137 58c54cbd90034d7db8a9c18f95eb78e6
msgid "The Part II ⇄ Part III mirror"
msgstr "**第二部分 ⇄ 第三部分的镜像**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:139 ddde60c12df14f1b80d39fa0309b4aac
msgid ""
"The two layers are not symmetric in their *content* — prose drifts, code "
"does not; prose has paragraphs, code has functions; prose is updated by "
"humans, code by commits. They are symmetric in their *operational shape*, "
"and the mirror is worth stating once so that Parts V and VI can rely on it:"
msgstr ""
"这两层**在 *内容* 上并不对称** —— **文稿会漂移，代码不会**；**文稿以段落为单位，代码以函数为单位**；**文稿由人类更新，代码由 "
"commit 更新**。它们**对称的是** *运维形状* ；**这次镜像值得明讲一次**，这样**第五和第六部分就可以依赖它**："

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 be61de6bc7ea4cc78a843bfb51a41a90
msgid "Part II (prose)"
msgstr "**第二部分（文稿）**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 6ef8203c106844e290d7cd958d9a7561
msgid "Part III (code)"
msgstr "**第三部分（代码）**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 2dfcced1fe394435abab9fb1d61c1990
msgid "Shared shape"
msgstr "**共享的形状**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 aead66c3700d4582943f8f722bd7b83b
msgid "Ch 4 File-based wiki"
msgstr "**第 4 章** 基于文件的 wiki"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 2b7aa973c25d4b1abeaf561c2d8de951
msgid "Ch 8 Why code is not prose"
msgstr "**第 8 章** 为什么代码不是文稿"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 4886de2aa9ff467393b0e7bee046f0fc
msgid "*Pick a substrate and name its contract*"
msgstr " *选定一个承载层，并命名它的契约* "

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 f8d7a9160b2846389b6aff598f3f685c
msgid "Ch 5 Frontmatter + footer"
msgstr "**第 5 章** frontmatter + footer"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 4320c22333234c0182890e142c56ede3
msgid "Ch 9 Parsing and entity extraction"
msgstr "**第 9 章** 解析与实体抽取"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 e32f351b1af54a4faa3249b896150c3c
msgid "*Make the contract machine-readable*"
msgstr " *把契约变得机器可读* "

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 f4f2cd2920d4460587c16aed2403a98c
msgid "Ch 6 Classification pipeline"
msgstr "**第 6 章** 分类流水线"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 770f6511488e438ab1d22c30a1f796a2
msgid "Ch 10 + Ch 11 Embeddings + graph"
msgstr "**第 10 + 11 章** embedding + 图谱"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 ef6b60e30dce4c01b9e2d4115df5d648
msgid "*Run a pipeline over the substrate*"
msgstr " *在承载层之上跑一条流水线* "

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 36ee7692b5e049fab7b2b04f07b35b2a
msgid "Ch 7 Publish + search (prefix index)"
msgstr "**第 7 章** 发布 + 搜索（**前缀索引**）"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 027fbb2287934f36b30592e9dd385b42
msgid "Ch 12 Hybrid retrieval + RRF"
msgstr "**第 12 章** 混合检索 + RRF"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 e31743cd8a42486ea3214c89078da573
msgid "*Expose the substrate for query*"
msgstr " *把承载层暴露出去以便查询* "

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 bd81414d11ec4c278f241be40f243809
msgid "Ch 7a Four-corner operational model"
msgstr "**第 7a 章** 四角运维模型"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 4125c877bcac41d4aff84edf1d944724
msgid "Ch 13 Prompt + generation"
msgstr "**第 13 章** Prompt + 生成"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:30 8a0e7f4a2f8242c590306212273ebf57
msgid "*Close with a stable shape the rest of the book refers to*"
msgstr " *以一个本书余下部分都会回头引用的稳定形状收尾* "

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:153 6351f65cbed34c42872a3dab492be05a
msgid ""
"The mirror is why the book's glossary (Appendix D) uses the same vocabulary "
"for both layers and why Chapter 18's document-layering tuple can treat prose"
" and code uniformly. It is also why teams that adopt Part II first and Part "
"III second usually *compress* Part III's timeline — the operational shape is"
" already in place."
msgstr ""
"**这次镜像**，**就是****本书词汇表（附录 D）对两层使用同一套词汇的原因**，也是**第 18 "
"章的文档分层元组****能够统一处理文稿和代码**的**原因**。**也是****那些先落地第二部分、再落地第三部分的团队****通常 "
"*把第三部分的时间线压短* 的原因** —— **那个运维形状**已经**到位了**。"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:159 5dcc313269f843b6b391d5f6be7fd130
msgid "Reading paths — pick one by the problem you have"
msgstr "**阅读路径 —— 按你手头的问题挑一条**"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:161 7a8b9788947f44b1881f7aea3f5ddb8e
msgid ""
"Part II is 1 600 lines of book. You do not need to read it linearly. Three "
"typical paths cover most readers' purposes:"
msgstr "**第二部分**有**一千六百行**。**你不需要按次序读它**。**三条典型路径**，**已经覆盖了多数读者的目的**："

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:164 3d5aa91d66364c5092aba0ca824e2691
msgid ""
"**\"I have 20 minutes before a meeting and I want the thesis.\"** Read the "
"hook opening and `## Why` of **Ch 4**, then the `## Why` of **Ch 7a**, then "
"Ch 7a's `## Part II in one page — a pointer checklist`. That is the whole "
"argument in three pages. Return for the mechanics later."
msgstr ""
"**“离开会还有 20 分钟，我只要论点。”** **读**：**第 4 章**的 hook 开场和 `## Why` ，接着**第 7a 章**的 "
"`## Why` ，然后**第 7a 章**的 `## Part II in one page — a pointer checklist` "
"。**这就是整套论证的三页版**。**机械细节**可以**晚点再回来看**。"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:170 a86377e2349d41ecb7e181c1a187f981
msgid ""
"**\"I am building the tool-chain.\"** Read **Ch 4 → Ch 5 → Ch 6** in order, "
"skipping the `## Competing approaches` tables on the first pass. Then read "
"the code references in `ch04/repository.go`, `ch05/frontmatter.go`, and "
"`ch06/pipeline.go`. Skim Ch 7; revisit Ch 7a after you have run the pipeline"
" once against a real corpus and want to know which rules to enforce."
msgstr ""
"**“我在搭工具链。”** **按序读**：**第 4 → 5 → 6 章**，**第一遍先跳过** `## Competing approaches`"
" 的表。**然后读代码引用**： `ch04/repository.go` 、 `ch05/frontmatter.go` 、 "
"`ch06/pipeline.go` 。**速读第 7 "
"章**；**等你已经对着一份真实语料跑过一遍流水线、****想知道要强制哪些规则时**，**再回头读第 7a 章**。"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:177 eb8c230a04a9435180a7ab88538f988f
msgid ""
"**\"I have an existing KB and I am doing a postmortem.\"** Skip the chapter "
"`## Why` sections and go straight to: **Ch 6 §\"How LLM classification fails"
" in production\"**, **Ch 7 §\"Where the tiny search engine fails\"**, and "
"**Ch 7a §\"What this model does *not* solve\"**. Cross-reference each "
"symptom you have seen in the wild against the Part II checklist in Ch 7a; "
"that will tell you which chapter to read in full."
msgstr ""
"**“我有一个现成的知识库，我在做事后复盘。”** **跳过各章的 `## Why` 小节**，**直接去读**：**第 6 章 §“How LLM "
"classification fails in production”**、**第 7 章 §“Where the tiny search engine"
" fails”**、以及**第 7a 章 §“What this model does *not* "
"solve”**。**把你在现场看到的每一个症状**，**去对照第 7a 章的第二部分清单**；**那会告诉你要完整读哪一章**。"

#: ../../part2-prose-layer/index.md:186 6fc0bbebeffc4ab9ab22e14f1a24ff8f
msgid ""
"These paths are the reason the part is shaped the way it is: each chapter "
"has a self-contained opening, a self-contained failure catalogue, and a "
"self-contained \"competing approaches\" table, so that a reader arriving "
"mid-part has a complete unit of thought to take away without reading the "
"part in order."
msgstr ""
"**这几条路径**，**就是这个部分被这样组织的原因**：**每一章**都**自带****一段自洽的开场、一份自洽的失败目录、****以及一张自洽的“竞品方案”表**"
" —— **这样****从这个部分中途走进来的读者****不用按序读，****也能带走一套完整的思考单元**。"

